description: Writing docs, README, STATUS and release notes for Ambar OS.
globs: docs/**, README.md, mkdocs.yml, FEATURES.md, CONTRIBUTING.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Docs

- `mkdocs build --strict` must pass; every page must be in the `nav` of `mkdocs.yml` (tested).
- Commands and flags shown in docs must exist in the real CLI (tested by `tests/test_docs.py`).
- `docs/STATUS.md` is the source of truth for what is proven. README and FEATURES must not claim more than it does.
- Plain language, short sentences, no hype. Say what was tested and how.
- Screenshots go in `docs/images/`, videos in `docs/media/` (keep files well under 10 MB).
